---
import type { Lang } from '../site';
import HubSpotForm from '../components/HubSpotForm.astro';
interface Props { lang: Lang }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="view on theme-research" id="v-careers">
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <h1><span class="en">Careers at Storm Research</span><span class="ja">採用情報</span></h1>
        <p class="lead"><span class="en lines"><span class="ln">Storm Research analyses small and mid cap Japanese equities and provides research and recommendations to clients.</span><span class="ln">Our team in Burton upon Trent focuses on research, analysis and communication.</span></span><span class="ja lines"><span class="ln">ストーム・リサーチは日本の中小型株を分析し、顧客にリサーチと推奨を提供しています。</span><span class="ln">バートン・アポン・トレントのチームは、リサーチ・分析・コミュニケーションを軸に活動しています。</span></span></p>
        <p><span class="en lines"><span class="ln">We are looking for capable, hardworking bilingual Japanese and English speakers, including people early in their careers.</span></span><span class="ja lines"><span class="ln">日本語と英語のバイリンガルで、意欲を持って取り組める方を募集しています。キャリアの浅い方も歓迎します。</span></span></p>
      </div>
      <h2><span class="en">About us</span><span class="ja">会社について</span></h2>
      <p class="aboutp"><span class="en lines"><span class="ln">Founded in 2009, Storm Research was built on long experience of the Japanese equity market,</span><span class="ln">combined with curiosity, creativity and attention to detail, to produce strong research.</span><span class="ln ln-wrap">Our services include analyst reports, investor meetings and feedback, translation and proofreading, international roadshows and bespoke company reports.</span></span><span class="ja lines"><span class="ln">2009年に設立したストーム・リサーチは、日本株市場での長年の経験に、</span><span class="ln">好奇心・創造性・細部へのこだわりを掛け合わせることで、優れたリサーチが生まれるという考えから始まりました。</span><span class="ln">アナリストレポート、投資家ミーティングとフィードバック、翻訳・校正、海外ロードショー、企業ごとのレポートなどを提供しています。</span></span></p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="tint">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2><span class="en">Why join Storm Research?</span><span class="ja">ストーム・リサーチで働く魅力</span></h2>
      <div class="whyjoin"><div><h3><span class="en">Tailored opportunities</span><span class="ja">一人ひとりに合った機会</span></h3><p><span class="en">Roles are shaped around each person's strengths.</span><span class="ja">それぞれの強みに合わせて役割を決めます。</span></p></div><div><h3><span class="en">Personal growth focus</span><span class="ja">成長を重視</span></h3><p><span class="en">Regular reviews support your development.</span><span class="ja">定期的な面談で成長をサポートします。</span></p></div><div><h3><span class="en">Global, bilingual work</span><span class="ja">グローバルな環境</span></h3><p><span class="en">Use Japanese and English every day, working with global investors and Japanese companies.</span><span class="ja">世界の投資家と日本企業をつなぐ仕事で、日本語と英語を毎日活かせます。</span></p></div><div><h3><span class="en">Impactful work</span><span class="ja">やりがいのある仕事</span></h3><p><span class="en">Take part in significant projects that build your career.</span><span class="ja">キャリアにつながる重要なプロジェクトに携われます。</span></p></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2><span class="en">Open roles</span><span class="ja">募集職種</span></h2>
      <p class="aboutp"><span class="en lines"><span class="ln">All roles are full-time and onsite in Burton upon Trent. Applicants need the right to work in the UK.</span></span><span class="ja lines"><span class="ln">すべての職種がフルタイム、バートン・アポン・トレントのオフィス勤務です。英国での就労資格が必要です。</span></span></p>
      <div class="roles">
        <article>
          <h3><span class="en">Analyst (trainee)</span><span class="ja">アナリスト（トレーニー）</span></h3>
          <p class="meta"><span class="en">Full-time<br>Onsite · Burton upon Trent</span><span class="ja">フルタイム<br>オフィス勤務・バートン・アポン・トレント</span></p>
          <h4><span class="en">Responsibilities</span><span class="ja">業務内容</span></h4><ul><li><span class="en">Gather, compile and organise financial data</span><span class="ja">財務データの収集・整理</span></li><li><span class="en">Record meeting notes and help draft reports and summaries</span><span class="ja">ミーティングの記録、レポートや要約の作成補助</span></li><li><span class="en">Work with senior analysts to interpret information and form recommendations</span><span class="ja">シニアアナリストと共に情報を分析し、推奨を検討</span></li></ul>
          <h4><span class="en">Required</span><span class="ja">必須条件</span></h4><ul><li><span class="en">Fluent written and spoken Japanese and English</span><span class="ja">日本語・英語の読み書き・会話が堪能</span></li><li><span class="en">Proficient in Microsoft Office</span><span class="ja">Microsoft Officeの実務スキル</span></li></ul>
          <h4><span class="en">Preferred</span><span class="ja">歓迎条件</span></h4><ul><li><span class="en">Communication skills</span><span class="ja">コミュニケーション能力</span></li><li><span class="en">Time management and teamwork</span><span class="ja">時間管理とチームワーク</span></li><li><span class="en">Thrives in a fast-paced environment</span><span class="ja">スピード感のある環境で力を発揮できる</span></li></ul>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3><span class="en">Sales (trainee)</span><span class="ja">セールス（トレーニー）</span></h3>
          <p class="meta"><span class="en">Full-time<br>Onsite · Burton upon Trent</span><span class="ja">フルタイム<br>オフィス勤務・バートン・アポン・トレント</span></p>
          <h4><span class="en">Responsibilities</span><span class="ja">業務内容</span></h4><ul><li><span class="en">Prospect and pitch our research services</span><span class="ja">リサーチサービスの新規開拓・提案</span></li><li><span class="en">Negotiate and close deals</span><span class="ja">条件交渉と契約締結</span></li><li><span class="en">Maintain client relationships and handle enquiries</span><span class="ja">顧客との関係維持、問い合わせ対応</span></li></ul>
          <h4><span class="en">Required</span><span class="ja">必須条件</span></h4><ul><li><span class="en">Fluent written and spoken Japanese and English</span><span class="ja">日本語・英語の読み書き・会話が堪能</span></li></ul>
          <h4><span class="en">Preferred</span><span class="ja">歓迎条件</span></h4><ul><li><span class="en">A friendly, confident manner</span><span class="ja">明るく自信を持った対応</span></li><li><span class="en">Microsoft Office, time management and teamwork</span><span class="ja">Microsoft Office、時間管理、チームワーク</span></li><li><span class="en">Customer service and adaptability</span><span class="ja">顧客対応力と柔軟性</span></li></ul>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3><span class="en">Editor / translator</span><span class="ja">エディター／翻訳</span></h3>
          <p class="meta"><span class="en">Full-time<br>Onsite · Burton upon Trent</span><span class="ja">フルタイム<br>オフィス勤務・バートン・アポン・トレント</span></p>
          <h4><span class="en">Responsibilities</span><span class="ja">業務内容</span></h4><ul><li><span class="en">Edit financial reports for clarity, consistency and accuracy</span><span class="ja">金融レポートを明確・一貫・正確に編集</span></li><li><span class="en">Format reports for publication</span><span class="ja">発行に向けたレポートの体裁調整</span></li><li><span class="en">Translate financial material between Japanese and English naturally</span><span class="ja">金融資料の自然な日英・英日翻訳</span></li></ul>
          <h4><span class="en">Required</span><span class="ja">必須条件</span></h4><ul><li><span class="en">Native-level English and strong Japanese</span><span class="ja">ネイティブレベルの英語力と高い日本語力</span></li><li><span class="en">Precise grammar and attention to detail</span><span class="ja">正確な文法力と細部への注意力</span></li><li><span class="en">Proficient in Microsoft Office</span><span class="ja">Microsoft Officeの実務スキル</span></li></ul>
          <h4><span class="en">Preferred</span><span class="ja">歓迎条件</span></h4><ul><li><span class="en">Strong communication</span><span class="ja">高いコミュニケーション能力</span></li><li><span class="en">Keeping tone and style consistent</span><span class="ja">トーンやスタイルの統一</span></li><li><span class="en">Collaboration and meeting deadlines</span><span class="ja">チームでの協働と納期の遵守</span></li></ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="tint" id="careers-apply">
    <div class="wrap formbox">
      <div>
        <h2><span class="en">How to apply</span><span class="ja">応募方法</span></h2>
        <p class="lead"><span class="en">Complete the application form, upload your CV, select the role and confirm your language skills and right to work in the UK.</span><span class="ja">応募フォームに必要事項を入力し、履歴書（CV）をアップロードしてください。<br class="pc">応募職種を選び、語学力と英国での就労資格をご確認ください。</span></p>
      </div>
      <HubSpotForm name="careers">
      <div class="formslot">
        <p class="formslot-note"><span class="en">On the live site, your current HubSpot application form appears here unchanged, with the same questions.</span><span class="ja">公開版では、現在のHubSpotの応募フォームを、質問内容はそのままでここに表示します。</span></p>
      </div>
      </HubSpotForm>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
